title: "Evidence-Driven Project State"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-driven, state-based framework for turning complex, multi-source
  project work into traceable project state, bounded action, and reviewable
  handoffs. Architecture-first today; the governance method is designed to
  generalize to consulting, product, research, and other knowledge-intensive
  work. Published as a research artifact; peer-reviewed claims are pending.
